lign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="v83"><mxGeometry x="374" y="54" width="222" height="236" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v88" value="" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;gradientColor=none;fillColor=#8C4FFF;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=11;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.internet_gateway;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1134" y="1290" width="46" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v89" value="&lt;b&gt;Internet Gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;subnet pública única&lt;br&gt;SG: Diameter SCTP 3868–3870 (proto 132)&lt;br&gt;rotas fixas para 172.23/16, 172.25/16 e 10.1/16 via TGW" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="v83"><mxGeometry x="666" y="54" width="222" height="236" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="v90" value="&lt;b&gt;Leitura do diagrama&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Entrega é &lt;b&gt;pull&lt;/b&gt;: GitHub Actions publica no ECR via OIDC; o ArgoCD lê o Git (deploy key SSH). O CI não faz deploy.&lt;br&gt;• Segredos: Secrets Manager → External Secrets (IRSA) → Secret → Reloader faz o rollout.&lt;br&gt;• Os 4 clusters &lt;b&gt;dividem a mesma VPC e as mesmas subnets privadas&lt;/b&gt;; o isolamento é por security group (regras de 443, 5432, 6379, 9098, 8099/9000).&lt;br&gt;• Os 3 clusters novos e o node group apps do workload &lt;b&gt;dormem&lt;/b&gt; fora da janela (aws_autoscaling_schedule → 0). O control plane, os NAT, os endpoints, os LBs e o RDS continuam cobrando 24×7.&lt;br&gt;• Lacunas abertas: sem TLS em Diameter, gRPC e ALB (TD-003/TD-006); RDS e Redis sem HA; o attachment do TGW de staging está desligado por flag.&lt;br&gt;• Linha tracejada = recurso desligado ou em transição." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#D6B656;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeWidth=1.5;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="v11"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="1112" width="920" height="300" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e91" value="push de imagens (OIDC → role github-actions-ecr-role)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;fontColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v4" target="v13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e92" value="API EKS pública (/32) · SSM" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;fontColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.55;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v6" target="v29"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e93" value="saída 0.0.0.0/0" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;fontColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v30" target="v2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e94" value="Diameter Ro/Gy/Sy (SCTP)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;fontColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v8" target="v81"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e95" value="attachment dev" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#545B64;fontColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.35;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v81" target="v83"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e96" value="attachment staging (enable_tgw_attachment=false)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1